		<item>
			<title>Arianne Phillips ready to work for Madonna's New Album on 2012.</title>
			<link>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/129-arianne-phillips-ready-to-work-for-madonnas-new-album-on-2012.html</link>
			<guid>http://www.drownedmadonna.com/index/item/129-arianne-phillips-ready-to-work-for-madonnas-new-album-on-2012.html</guid>
			<description><![CDATA[<div class="K2FeedIntroText"><p><strong>Arianne Phillips</strong> has just finished working on <strong>Madonna</strong>'s second directoral film W.E. and is already thinking about her next adventure with her Madgesty.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>"<strong>Madonna</strong> has a lot of new stuff coming out in the New Year as well because she’s recording an <strong>album</strong>, so we’re going to have so much to do," <strong>Arianne Phillips</strong> told <strong>WWD</strong>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>This includes a promo tour in Spring 2012 as well as a world tour on summer 2012. We can't wait to see what <strong>Madonna</strong> and talented <strong>Arianne</strong> will come with next year!</p>
<p> </p></div>]]></description>
